    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const text = ($json.text || '').replace(/\"/g, \"'\");\nconst systemPrompt = `You are an intent classifier for a courier/logistics WhatsApp bot for a company in Pakistan.\nClassify the customer's message into exactly one intent:\n- track_shipment: asking to track/locate a parcel, or why it's delayed, or when it will arrive\n- shipping_cost: asking how much it costs to send a parcel\n- courier_branch: asking for nearest branch/office address or phone\n- pickup_booking: wants to schedule/book a pickup\n- faq: general questions about policies, delivery time, prohibited items, COD, international shipping, cancellation\n- human_support: wants to talk to a human agent / support\n- fallback: anything else / unclear\n\nAlso extract these fields if present, otherwise use null:\ntrackingId (format TRK followed by digits), city, weight (number in kg), destinationType (one of same_city, same_province, nationwide), name, phone, address, pickupDate\n\nCustomer message: \"${text}\"\n\nRespond with ONLY a single valid JSON object, no explanation, no markdown, in exactly this shape:\n{\"intent\":\"\",\"trackingId\":null,\"city\":null,\"weight\":null,\"destinationType\":null,\"name\":null,\"phone\":null,\"address\":null,\"pickupDate\":null}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    prompt: systemPrompt,\n    model: $env.OLLAMA_MODEL || 'qwen2.5:7b'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "n8-build-prompt",
      "name": "Build Intent Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [880, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.OLLAMA_URL || 'http://localhost:11434') + '/api/generate' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $json.model, prompt: $json.prompt, stream: false, format: \"json\" }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 60000 }
      },
      "id": "n9-ollama",
      "name": "Ollama Intent Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let parsed = {};\ntry {\n  const raw = $json.response;\n  parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = { intent: 'fallback' };\n}\n\nconst allowed = ['track_shipment','shipping_cost','courier_branch','pickup_booking','faq','human_support','fallback'];\nif (!allowed.includes(parsed.intent)) parsed.intent = 'fallback';\n\nconst originalText = $('Extract Message Data').first().json.text || '';\nif (!parsed.trackingId) {\n  const match = originalText.match(/TRK\\d+/i);\n  if (match) parsed.trackingId = match[0].toUpperCase();\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...parsed,\n    from: $('Extract Message Data').first().json.from,\n    originalText\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "n10-parse-intent",
      "name": "Parse Intent Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1320, 440]
